@startuml
title Change3 - cumulative architecture
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class ApplicationController
class BookingsController
class RoomsController
class SettingsController
class CrudConcern <<mixin>>
class Booking
class Room
class User
class BookingService
class AdditionalServicePricing
class RoomUpgrade
class CancellationService
class CancellationPolicy
ApplicationController <|-- BookingsController
ApplicationController <|-- RoomsController
ApplicationController <|-- SettingsController
BookingsController ..> CrudConcern : include
RoomsController ..> CrudConcern : include
SettingsController ..> CrudConcern : include
BookingsController ..> Booking
BookingsController ..> CancellationService
Booking --> User
Booking --> Room : current / original room
Booking *-- BookingService
Booking ..> AdditionalServicePricing
RoomUpgrade --> Booking
RoomUpgrade --> Room
CancellationService --> Booking
CancellationService --> CancellationPolicy
note bottom of RoomUpgrade
  Domain operation; no controller route added.
  Availability uses Booking.active from Change2.
end note
note right of CrudConcern
  Preserved Template Method.
  Mixin inclusion is not class inheritance.
end note
@enduml
